exports[`Lumen & Loom Studio > Business System › 2. Customer Engagement > tile segment-8lu427u5:value-proposition 1`] = `
"Value PropositionValue PropositioniValue PropositioniAdd a draft for Homeware CollectionAdd a draft for Weaving WorkshopsFor Londoners who want a calm, personal home without the throwaway cycle, Lumen & Loom makes handwoven cushions, throws and linens in Hackney from traceable British wool and organic cotton. Each piece is signed by its maker and repaired for life, and we teach you to weave your own. You know exactly who made it, where the yarn came from, and that it will last.Emotional NeedsCalmFulfilledDelightedProudNurturedSocial NeedsStylishIncludedAltruisticBack‹›Back
[fields] For Londoners who want a calm, personal home without the throwaway cycle, Lumen & Loom makes handwoven cushions, throws and linens in Hackney from traceable British wool and organic cotton. Each piece is signed by its maker and repaired for life, and we teach you to weave your own. You know exactly who made it, where the yarn came from, and that it will last."
`;

