"Financial PositionFinancial PositioniAdditional financing required: £25,864Funding Needi£61,864Available Nowi£32,000Confirmed Futurei£4,000Pendingi£26,000Funding Gapi£25,864Financial Runwayi19 monthsFunding Need CoverageiEstablishment£8,000 of £7,680Operating£15,000 of £41,419Offering£0 of £12,765Funding MixiFounder's & Own Capital21% · £13,000 confirmedGrants & Non-repayable13% · £8,000 confirmedInvestment (Equity)32% · £0 confirmed · £20,000 pendingLoans (Debt)24% · £15,000 confirmedOther10% · £0 confirmed · £6,000 pendingFunding TimelineiMoney inMoney outBalanceShow as table-£20,000£0£20,000Apr 2025Jul 2025Oct 2025Jan 2026Apr 2026Jul 2026Oct 2026Jan 2027Apr 2027Jul 2027Oct 2027Mar 2028Funds run outUpcoming ObligationsiNothing significant scheduled in the next six months.Decision Signals!Funding Gap. Additional financing of £25,864 is required.iLoan. Start Up Loan repayments begin in Nov 2026 and create an estimated monthly obligation of £290, with £2,400 of interest in total.▲Runway. Based on current available funds, identified costs and expected revenue, the organisation can operate for approximately 19 months before available funds are exhausted (lowest point -£25,864 in Oct 2027).iIn-kind Contributions. In-kind contributions worth £1,500 are recorded but not counted as cash: they cannot pay a bill.!Funding Being Sought Falls Short. With the £26,000 being sought, cash still falls £18,074 short in May 2027, once its repayments are counted. Seek more, on longer terms, or reduce costs.11 costs paid per unit, per order, per project or by usage depend on activity and are not in the timeline. Sustainability counts those paid per unit, per order or per project against revenue; one paid by usage needs a per-unit, per-project or periodic basis to be counted.These are observations calculated from the information entered, not financial advice.Funding NeediCalculated from the costs above. To change a need, change the costs it is made of. Until revenue is estimated in Revenue Streams, every running cost is counted in the operating need; it then falls to the months before revenue covers them.Establishmenti£7,680Mar 2026 – Oct 2026Incorporation£50Trade mark£220Worktables & open shelving£900Task lighting£240Studio fit-out and signage£1,200Yarn storage racking£380Label printer£520Photo lighting£420Hackney Wick Maker Yard: deposit£3,750Total£7,680Operatingi£41,419Apr 2025 – Oct 2027MonthRunning CostsCosts of SalesRepaymentsiRevenueNetRunning TotalNeededApr 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0May 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0Jun 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0Jul 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0Aug 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0Sep 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0Oct 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0Nov 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0Dec 2025£0£0£0£0£0£0Jan 2026£0£0£0£0£0£0Feb 2026£0£0£0£0£0£0Mar 2026£0£0£0£0£0£0First year£41,419Revenue covers the running costs from the start.Offeringi£12,765Oct 20268-shaft floor looms£7,200Frame looms for workshops£640Sample swatch boxes£375Stall display kit£340SumUp card reader£30Market trading licence£180Motif licence£4,000Total£12,765Cash to raise before the openingi£0 Capital Expenditure£0Startup Expenses£0Pre-Operating Expenses£0Total Pre-operational Budget£0Startup Contingency Fund (10%)£0Opening inventory£0Total£0Operational Contingency Fundi£21,7823 months of OpExOpEx a month£7,261Set aside each month (4%)£290Held at the opening (the startup fund)£0Months to reach the target75Total Funding Need: £61,864Back‹›Back
