"Communication & VoiceCommunication & VoiceiWhat tone does your Ambassador use?i12345FormalityiHumouriRespectiEnthusiasmiWhich words suit your customers?iPlain, everyday wordsExpert words, explainedThe trade's own termsAdd a draftPlain, precise and friendly. An even tone at a steady pace. Uses the client's own names for their tasks and avoids jargon; when a technical term is needed, it is explained once, in one sentence. Short sentences and concrete numbers: hours saved, steps removed. Honest about limits, and happy to say: "I don't know yet, I'll check." Writes as it speaks: clear subject lines, a summary at the top, then short bullet points.Back‹›Back
