"SustainabilitySustainabilityiFinancial RiskAvailable resources are expected to be exhausted in Feb 2027, before break even in Jul 2027. Additional funding, lower costs, earlier revenue, higher prices or greater volume may be needed.Expected Monthly Revenuei$14,250at the normal levelBreak-Even Revenuei$5,796a monthExpected Break EveniJul 2027Month 12 of the planFinancial ExhaustioniFeb 2027Month 7 of the planSustainability Bufferin/afunds run out before break evenExpected Monthly Revenue$14,250Break-Even Revenue$5,796Break-Even Activity≈ 0.6 projects a month (AI Workflow Audit)≈ 0.2 projects a month (Automation Build)≈ 2 active clients (Automation Care Retainer)Expected Break EvenJul 2027Financial ExhaustionFeb 2027Sustainability Buffern/a!Financial Risk. Available resources are expected to be exhausted in Feb 2027, before break even in Jul 2027. Additional funding, lower costs, earlier revenue, higher prices or greater volume may be needed.▲Funding Dependency. Much of the financing this assessment relies on (58%) is not yet confirmed, and is not counted until it is.Based on the current assumptions only. These are estimates, not guarantees or financial advice.Stress TestiThe plan does not hold even as planned: cash falls $1,208 short in Jul 2027. The hardest case, all four together, falls $30,959 short.Counting the $15,000 being sought as if it arrives as planned, its repayments included.CaseBreak EvenLowest CashResultAs plannedJul 2027-$1,208, Jul 2027$1,208 shortSales 20% lowerSep 2027-$5,419, Sep 2027$5,419 shortRevenue 3 months laterOct 2027-$18,599, Oct 2027$18,599 shortCosts 10% higherJul 2027-$2,264, Jul 2027$2,264 shortCustomers pay 1 month laterJul 2027-$7,668, Aug 2027$7,668 shortAll four togetherDec 2027-$30,959, Jan 2028$30,959 shortWhat It Would TakeiTo keep cash above zero through the plan, with the $15,000 being sought, any one of these would do:$1,208 more funding, by Jun 2027Prices 9% higherSales 10% higherCosts 12% lower, founders' pay asideRevenue starting 1 month earlierEach on its own, with everything else as planned; a mix of smaller changes can do the same.Back‹›Back
[fields] "
`;

