"Financial PositionFinancial PositioniAdditional financing required: $14,842Funding Needi$25,542Available Nowi$10,700Confirmed Futurei$0Pendingi$15,000Funding Gapi$14,842Financial Runwayi6 monthsFunding Need CoverageiEstablishment$0 of $9,265Operating$0 of $16,277Funding MixiFounder's & Own Capital42% · $10,700 confirmedLoans (Debt)58% · $0 confirmed · $15,000 pendingFunding TimelineiMoney inMoney outBalanceShow as table$0$50,000$100,000Aug 2026Nov 2026Feb 2027May 2027Aug 2027Nov 2027Feb 2028May 2028Aug 2028Nov 2028Feb 2029Jul 2029Funds run outUpcoming ObligationsiJan 2027Launch web design (Per project)−$1,500Jan 2027Lawyer (Per project)−$1,200Decision Signals!Funding Gap. Additional financing of $14,842 is required.iLoan. SBA Microloan repayments begin in Mar 2027 and create an estimated monthly obligation of $470, with $1,922 of interest in total.▲Runway. Based on current available funds, identified costs and expected revenue, the organisation can operate for approximately 6 months before available funds are exhausted (lowest point -$14,059 in Jun 2027).▲Funding Dependency. A significant proportion of planned financing (58%) depends on funding that has not yet been confirmed.!Funding Being Sought Falls Short. With the $15,000 being sought, cash still falls $1,208 short in Jul 2027, once its repayments are counted. Seek more, on longer terms, or reduce costs.6 costs paid per unit, per order, per project or by usage depend on activity and are not in the timeline. Sustainability counts those paid per unit, per order or per project against revenue; one paid by usage needs a per-unit, per-project or periodic basis to be counted.These are observations calculated from the information entered, not financial advice.Funding NeediCalculated from the costs above. To change a need, change the costs it is made of. Until revenue is estimated in Revenue Streams, every running cost is counted in the operating need; it then falls to the months before revenue covers them.Establishme